      "mergeID": "629ee16115e8b30b61b4fb4d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I love the new re-vamped world menu that you have on the VRChat website!\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/worlds\nIf any changes are going to be added or modified in the future, I'd like to request the ability to favorite or unfavorite a world when you click on the URL.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add ability to favorite worlds via website",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5cbc9b5c960c9009f1fc3665",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Either that, or maybe a \"world queue\", kind of like YouTube's \"Watch Later\" so I have a list of worlds lined up next time I go into VRChat.\nEither way, some way to add worlds to my list on web would be super useful: I always see cool worlds announced by tweet or on Discord, and when I go in VR I forget which ones I wanted to go visit.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
