  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would love to be able to manage my favorite worlds playlists through the website. The feature could be a new button titled \"Playlists\" or something.  This would allow me to search for worlds on the site and create a playlist of worlds to explore in game later. It would also allow me to rearrange worlds I've already favorited.  \n\nI really want to build out that \"Escape Hatch\" playlist for when we have a busy room and need a quick escape into a lower intensity worlds like my new favorite...Error.mdl's LOADING world.  \n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_0ac5cad0-759f-415e-9690-acd22fbb063f",
